emon who  apparently turned on her fellow Knights  and protected  upon hearing these rooms the church  sends some of its best knights into the  valley to discover the truth Vita the  moonlight Knight Rossio of Easter Elle  and salon Vinland many honorable Knights  have ventured into boletaria  in search of the valley of defilement  the vicious rumors about Austria offend  our most basic sense of respect for  God's name however none of these great  Knights has made it back could it be  that the wretched Valley is so infested  with grime that even our Lord's voice  does not resonate there or perhaps it is  the fate of those left behind by God we  find the corpse of Beto covered in slugs  and fall into the valley above the leech  manga is also the Zayas wooden spear she  presumably fell below to be consumed by  leeches people whisper that these  adventurers fell at the demoness  Striders hand ever since that demon  witch came here everything has turned  foul all the men worship her like she's  the Virgin Mary the same man who would  snatch my child away from me this was a  much better place before she came  Australia is indeed the Archdemon at the  center of the valley though while the  valley brims with grime it also feels  strangely pure but the last night we  sent into the swamp still lives and we  find her here now why you are one of the  sane ones are you not I am selling of  the West I seek my brother garl Vinland  the knight who accompanied Saint Astraea  on her travels  I believe they settled here if you  happen to see my younger brother please  tell me I must share with him the last  words of our Father I heard an  unflattering rumor about Saint Astraea  have you met that herb peddling woman  she claims that Saint Astraea is herself  a demon that woman has no reason to lie  surely she must be mistaken I find  something odd about this place it brims  with grime but at once feels strangely  pure Zelan holds the ring of devout Pro  which she intends to give to her brother  it is the sister ring to the ring of  sincere prayer a holy relic that  increases the power of miracles when  Austria was a young girl she found the  ring of sincere prayer a discovery that  instantly propelled her into sainthood  the ring they said was a revelation of  God a sign that God himself had chosen  the girl for great things when Austria  became a saint she took on the knight  garl Vinland Ghul was a night of the  Vinland family a powerful family within  the church and likely a friend of  Austria since their childhood he was to  serve as her bodyguard and whether or  not he was more than a friend  he served her loyally and the two  remained inseparable it's common for the  people of the church to embark on  pilgrimage a journey of spiritual  significance or awakening when a stray  learned of the suffering within the  valley of defilement she embarked on a  pilgrimage to search for it when she and  her Knights found the valley she must  have seen a land abandoned by God full  of suffering and those who were to be  forgotten this filthy woman tells us  that Austria made things worse but she  is simply jealous of Australia for  before Australia came the filthy woman  was the apple of every man's eye in  truth Austria did great good in the  valley her heart was broken by the  plight of the depraved and she cared for  them and healed them and they worshipped  her as a christ-like figure for she  cared for them when no one else would so  by the time the demon fog rolled over  the world and through the valley of  defilement Austria had changed the  valley had stripped her of any belief in  her God how could a benevolent God allow  these people to suffer the church wasn't  worshipping God it was more like they  were worshipping the devil so she made a  decision instead of fighting the demon  fog Austria embraced it becoming the  first human to successfully weather the  transformation into  demon she kept her sanity her  personality and her form the only